  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAO G20 Alliance against Hunger and Poverty</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">It has been politically decided that Norway will support the support mechanism for the G20 Global Alliance against Hunger and Poverty. This mechanism will be hosted by the UN Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO). In 2025, a multi-donor trust fund for contributions was established. The Norwegian contribution of USD 1 million amounts to approximately NOK 10,500,000 at the time of disbursement. This is the first and only planned disbursement under the agreement.</narrative>
  </description>
